msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Hey, I'm Tom. If you wanna see a military base or get\r\n"
"to know this place, then I'm your go-to guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"How about it? I could show you to a nice barbecue spot.\r\n"
"Their service is the best in town!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"(Wasn't there a rumor about people being abducted by a\r\n"
"foreign phantom or something in front of the station...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "How about it? I'll give you a fine tour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Actually, I heard a girl recently went missing in this area.\r\n"
"Happen to know anything about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Nope, nothing at all! Absolutely nothing! Not even the slightest bit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "...All right then."
msgstr "Va bene allora."

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"If you do decide you want a fine tour of Okinawa, come back\r\n"
"and let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Fine. Show me around town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear! You look like a drinkin' man.\r\n"
"How about I take you on the special adult tour today?"
msgstr ""

